{"id":"witz","lemma":"Witz","pos":"noun","rank":746,"glosses":["joke","joke (something that is not taken seriously, e.g. due to being very easy, very ineffective, or very arbitrary)","wit, humour"],"ipa":"/vɪt͡s/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a1/De-Witz.ogg/De-Witz.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Witzes","plural":"Witze"},"examples":[{"text":"Es war ein Witz.","en":"It was a joke.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/87639","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Ich vermisse deine Witze.","en":"I miss your jokes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/698762","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to miss","l":"vermissen"},{"g":"your","l":"dein"},null]},{"text":"Kannst du uns einen Witz erzählen?","en":"Can you tell us a joke?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"to tell"}]},{"text":"Ich kenne viele Witze.","en":"I know lots of jokes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/698760","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"kennen"},{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},null]},{"text":"Das ist kein Witz.","en":"It is no joke.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/394816","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"no / not a"},null]}]}